As mentioned in the installation guide, did you install the Microsoft C 
runtime library patch in case of 'C runtime error exception' ? Did you 
set the PATH system environment to point to 'c:\opt\gtk\bin' ? During 
ImageMagick installation, did you check the box to install development 
headers and libraries ?

Are GTK+ and ImageMagick working ? Did you try the command 'gtk-demo' in 
the Windows command line ? What is the result of 'convert' (coming from 
