Hi Peng,

It depends on what kind of annotation package you are looking for.  If
you want the kind used by oligo, then you probably want 
pd.moex.1.0.st.v1  mogene10stprobeset.db  is more of a classic gene
centric "probes" style package...

You can see pd.moex.1.0.st.v1 here:

http://www.bioconductor.org/packages/devel/data/annotation/html/pd.moex.1.0.st.v1.html


  Marc





